  "blocks": {
    "intro--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "intro--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "intro--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "冒泡排序只做一种操作：比较相邻的两个数，前一个比后一个大就交换。从左到右这样走一遍称为一趟。一趟走完，最大的数一定落在末尾，因为它在每次比较中都比右边的数大，会被一路换到最后。本页用 5、2、4、1、3 这五个数演示一趟。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "pass--sort-code": {
      "id": "pass--sort-code",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "value": "def bubble_pass(a):\n    for i in range(len(a) - 1):\n        if a[i] > a[i + 1]:\n            a[i], a[i + 1] = a[i + 1], a[i]\n    return a"
    },
    "pass--stats": {
      "id": "pass--stats",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "pass--stats--definition",
      "parameters": {}
    },
    "pass--bubble": {
      "id": "pass--bubble",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "pass--bubble--definition",
      "parameters": {
        "scene": "bubble",
        "alt": "5 2 4 1 3 的一趟冒泡：5 与右边的数逐个比较、交换，最后停在末尾。"
      }
    },
    "summary--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "summary--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "summary--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "一趟冒泡比较了四次，把五个数中最大的 5 放到了末尾。下一趟只需处理前四个数，再把其中最大的放到倒数第二位。每一趟让一个数归位，所以 n 个数最多 n − 1 趟就排好了序。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "intro--keywords": {
      "id": "intro--keywords",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "intro--keywords--rule",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "比较相邻两数，前大则交换"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "intro--keywords--claim",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "一趟：最大的数到末尾"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "slides",
        "lecture"
      ]
    },
    "pass--explain": {
      "id": "pass--explain",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "pass--explain--code",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "函数 bubble_pass 做一趟冒泡：下标 i 从左向右移动，a[i] 大于 a[i + 1] 时交换这两个数。五个数有四对相邻位置，所以一趟比较四次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "pass--explain--trace",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "动画中，5 先与 2 比较，5 更大，两者交换；接着 5 与 4 比较，再次交换；随后 5 依次越过 1 和 3，停在末尾，变为绿色。计数器随讲解累计比较次数，也可以点“比较一次”自己计数。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ]
    },
    "summary--keywords": {
      "id": "summary--keywords",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "summary--keywords--pass",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "一趟：4 次比较，最大的数归位"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "summary--keywords--total",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "n 个数：最多 n − 1 趟"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "slides",
        "lecture"
      ]
    }
  },
