  "narrations": {
    "intro--paragraph-1--narration": {
      "id": "intro--paragraph-1--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "冒泡排序只做一件事：比较相邻的两个数，前面的大，就交换。从左走到右，这叫一趟。走完一趟，最大的数就到了最后。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pass--paragraph-1--narration": {
      "id": "pass--paragraph-1--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "这是五个数：5、2、4、1、3。我们从左往右，每次只比较相邻的两个。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pass--paragraph-2--narration": {
      "id": "pass--paragraph-2--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "第一次，比较 5 和 2。"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-pass-1",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "click",
          "target": {
            "blockId": "pass--stats"
          },
          "parameters": {
            "arg": "compare"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 计数器记下一次比较。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pass--paragraph-3--narration": {
      "id": "pass--paragraph-3--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5 比 2 大，所以交换。"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-pass-1-2",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "spot",
          "target": {
            "blockId": "pass--sort-code"
          },
          "parameters": {
            "lines": "3-4"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 代码里就是这两行：判断，然后互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pass--paragraph-4--narration": {
      "id": "pass--paragraph-4--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "接着比较 5 和 4，"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-pass-1-3",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "click",
          "target": {
            "blockId": "pass--stats"
          },
          "parameters": {
            "arg": "compare"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 还是前面的大，再交换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pass--paragraph-5--narration": {
      "id": "pass--paragraph-5--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5 再和 1 比，"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-pass-1-5",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "click",
          "target": {
            "blockId": "pass--stats"
          },
          "parameters": {
            "arg": "compare"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 和 3 比，"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-pass-1-6",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "click",
          "target": {
            "blockId": "pass--stats"
          },
          "parameters": {
            "arg": "compare"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 每次都交换。"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-pass-1-4",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "pause"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 它停在最后。这一趟，一共比较了四次。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "summary--paragraph-1--narration": {
      "id": "summary--paragraph-1--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "一趟下来，最大的数归位了。剩下四个数再走一趟，又有一个归位。所以五个数，最多四趟就排好。"
        }
      ]
    }
